{
    "name": "WhatsApp Bot (OpenWA) - Combined: Ingestion + Handler + Logger",
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "note-001",
            "name": "Setup Notes",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                -1400,
                -200
            ],
            "parameters": {
                "width": 480,
                "height": 420,
                "content": "## Assumptions to verify before running\n\n**CSV columns assumed:**\n- customer_qnas.csv: Category, Question, Answer, Reference_URL\n- product_info.csv: product_name, category, description, price, sku, availability\n- order_data.csv: phone_number, order_id, product_name, quantity, order_status, order_date\n\nAdjust the 'Format Rows as Chunks', 'Upsert Orders Table', and 'Build Customer Context' nodes if your real headers differ.\n\n**Postgres tables expected (create via init-db if missing):**\n- kb_embeddings(id, content text, metadata jsonb, embedding vector(1536))\n- orders(phone_number text, order_id text, product_name text, quantity int, order_status text, order_date date, updated_at timestamptz default now(), PRIMARY KEY(phone_number, order_id))\n- conversations(id serial, chat_id text, from_number text, session_id text, user_message text, bot_reply text, created_at timestamptz default now())\n\n**Credentials needed:** OpenAI, Postgres (isolated openwa_user), OpenWA API Key (HTTP Header Auth: X-API-Key)\n\n**File paths assumed:** /data/kb/customer_qnas.csv, /data/kb/product_info.csv, /data/kb/order_data.csv (adjust to your mounted volume path)"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "trig-schedule-001",
            "name": "KB Ingestion Schedule",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
            "typeVersion": 1.2,
            "position": [
                -1400,
                300
            ],
            "parameters": {
                "rule": {
                    "interval": [
                        {
                            "field": "weeks",
                            "weeksInterval": 1,
                            "triggerAtDay": [
                                1
                            ],
                            "triggerAtHour": 2
                        }
                    ]
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "code-kb-filelist-001",
            "name": "Define KB File List",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                -1180,
                300
            ],
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "return [\n  { json: { fileName: 'customer_qnas.csv', filePath: '/data/kb/customer_qnas.csv', kbType: 'embed', sourceLabel: 'faq' } },\n  { json: { fileName: 'product_info.csv', filePath: '/data/kb/product_info.csv', kbType: 'embed', sourceLabel: 'product' } },\n  { json: { fileName: 'order_data.csv', filePath: '/data/kb/order_data.csv', kbType: 'relational', sourceLabel: 'orders' } }\n];"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "switch-kbtype-001",
            "name": "Route by KB Type",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
            "typeVersion": 3,
            "position": [
                -960,
                300
            ],
            "parameters": {
                "rules": {
                    "values": [
                        {
                            "outputKey": "embed",
                            "conditions": {
                                "options": {
                                    "caseSensitive": true,
                                    "typeValidation": "loose"
                                },
                                "combinator": "and",
                                "conditions": [
                                    {
                                        "leftValue": "={{ $json.kbType }}",
                                        "rightValue": "embed",
                                        "operator": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "operation": "equals"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "outputKey": "relational",
                            "conditions": {
                                "options": {
                                    "caseSensitive": true,
                                    "typeValidation": "loose"
                                },
                                "combinator": "and",
                                "conditions": [
                                    {
                                        "leftValue": "={{ $json.kbType }}",
                                        "rightValue": "relational",
                                        "operator": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "operation": "equals"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "options": {}
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "read-embed-001",
            "name": "Read KB File (Embed)",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                -740,
                180
            ],
            "parameters": {
                "operation": "read",
                "fileSelector": "={{ $json.filePath }}",
                "options": {}
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "extract-embed-001",
            "name": "Parse CSV Rows (Embed)",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                -540,
                180
            ],
            "parameters": {
                "operation": "csv",
                "options": {}
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "code-format-chunks-001",
            "name": "Format Rows as Chunks",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                -340,
                180
            ],
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// Turns each CSV row into a text chunk + metadata for embedding.\n// Handles both customer_qnas.csv (Category, Question, Answer, Reference_URL)\n// and product_info.csv (product_name, category, description, price, sku, availability).\nconst items = $input.all();\nconst out = [];\n\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const row = item.json;\n  let pageContent = '';\n\n  if (row.Question || row.question) {\n    const q = row.Question || row.question;\n    const a = row.Answer || row.answer;\n    const cat = row.Category || row.category || '';\n    pageContent = `Category: ${cat}\\nQ: ${q}\\nA: ${a}`;\n  } else if (row.product_name) {\n    pageContent = `Product: ${row.product_name}\\nCategory: ${row.category || ''}\\nDescription: ${row.description || ''}\\nPrice: ${row.price || ''}\\nSKU: ${row.sku || ''}\\nAvailability: ${row.availability || ''}`;\n  } else {\n    // Fallback: dump all columns\n    pageContent = Object.entries(row).map(([k, v]) => `${k}: ${v}`).join('\\n');\n  }\n\n  out.push({\n    json: {\n      pageContent,\n      metadata: { source: $('Define KB File List').first().json.fileName, sourceLabel: $('Define KB File List').first().json.sourceLabel }\n    }\n  });\n}\n\nreturn out;"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "embed-ingest-001",
            "name": "Embeddings OpenAI (Ingestion)",
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsOpenAi",
            "typeVersion": 1.2,
            "position": [
                -340,
                380
            ],
            "parameters": {
                "options": {}
            },
            "credentials": {
                "openAiApi": {
                    "id": "REPLACE_ME",
